1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,810
<i>I want to break up.</i>

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:06,360
<i>She found out about the real me.</i>

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:09,270
I'm in love with you, Ama.

4
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,490
I'm sorry.

5
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:12,190
Is this true?
[Love Triangle]

6
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,910
I'm so sorry.

7
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:16,878
[Chiaki Hosho's Hidden Past]
What is this?

8
00:00:16,878 --> 00:00:18,718
<i>You're working hard.</i>

9
00:00:18,718 --> 00:00:20,918
I know that.

10
00:00:20,918 --> 00:00:24,278
I don't want your future ruined
by an article like that.

11
00:00:24,278 --> 00:00:28,238
Even now, I'll continue to support you.

12
00:00:28,908 --> 00:00:32,288
I still love you.

13
00:00:32,288 --> 00:00:35,548
<i>I want to stay by your side.</i>

14
00:00:35,548 --> 00:00:37,908
I still love you, Chiaki.

15
00:00:37,908 --> 00:00:41,825
<i>Women easily mix up love and guilt.</i>

16
00:00:41,825 --> 00:00:44,288
<i>I love you, Ama.</i>

17
00:00:44,288 --> 00:00:46,898
<i>It's Seira's first Japanese drama in a while.</i>

18
00:00:46,898 --> 00:00:49,688
<i>You're Ama Minase, right?</i>

19
00:00:49,688 --> 00:00:52,678
You're Chiaki's girlfriend now, aren't you?

20
00:01:28,478 --> 00:01:31,258
That was jealousy.

21
00:01:31,258 --> 00:01:34,428
It must be hard for you.

22
00:01:34,428 --> 00:01:38,058
He's so possessive.

23
00:01:43,858 --> 00:01:45,458
Stop it.

24
00:01:50,718 --> 00:01:52,618
You're adorable.

25
00:01:56,118 --> 00:01:57,828
Oh, really.

26
00:02:00,028 --> 00:02:02,958
You really are twisted.

27
00:02:04,738 --> 00:02:07,418
That's funny, coming from you.

28
00:02:11,888 --> 00:02:13,768
I want you...

29
00:02:14,948 --> 00:02:17,428
to be happy.

30
00:02:30,208 --> 00:02:32,578
How's the new filming set?

31
00:02:33,778 --> 00:02:38,258
The staff are all nice
and serious about their work.

32
00:02:43,038 --> 00:02:44,488
What's wrong?

33
00:02:45,368 --> 00:02:49,168
I still can't connect with the character.

34
00:02:50,508 --> 00:02:52,078
I see.

35
00:02:53,848 --> 00:02:58,568
In a fit of jealous rage,
she kills the person she was cheating with.

36
00:02:59,208 --> 00:03:01,648
But I can't grasp those emotions.

37
00:03:03,608 --> 00:03:09,198
I can't only rely
on my own experiences forever, huh?

38
00:03:12,468 --> 00:03:14,028
Hey, Ama.

39
00:03:16,638 --> 00:03:18,828
How are your co-stars?

40
00:03:28,548 --> 00:03:30,878
I wonder if I know any of them.

41
00:03:33,638 --> 00:03:36,018
You see, Chiaki...

42
00:03:36,018 --> 00:03:37,358
What?

43
00:03:43,018 --> 00:03:44,828
Never mind.

44
00:03:44,828 --> 00:03:47,148
Everyone's really kind.

45
00:03:49,478 --> 00:03:51,428
<i>So easy to read.</i>

46
00:03:52,218 --> 00:03:54,408
<i>You're so cute.</i>

47
00:03:57,028 --> 00:03:58,498
What?

48
00:03:59,458 --> 00:04:02,818
It's nothing.

49
00:04:02,818 --> 00:04:06,998
I just wish I could
be of some help to you, Ama.

50
00:04:09,428 --> 00:04:12,128
Good luck with your shoot.

51
00:04:41,718 --> 00:04:44,488
You really are twisted.

52
00:04:49,518 --> 00:04:53,508
<i>I know that better than anyone.</i>

53
00:04:59,638 --> 00:05:04,048
<i>I wish I had a cage to lock Ama away in.</i>

54
00:05:05,838 --> 00:05:07,808
<i>She belongs only to me.</i>

55
00:05:10,758 --> 00:05:13,038
<i>I don't want anyone to see her.</i>

56
00:05:14,168 --> 00:05:16,808
<i>No one can touch her.</i>

57
00:06:15,298 --> 00:06:17,148
You're...

58
00:06:17,148 --> 00:06:22,272
You said you love me the most.
Was that a lie?

59
00:06:23,078 --> 00:06:24,568
That's...

60
00:06:24,568 --> 00:06:27,037
Don't look at any other woman.

61
00:06:28,038 --> 00:06:30,938
Look only at me!

62
00:06:41,108 --> 00:06:42,736
- Cut!
- Cut!

63
00:06:42,736 --> 00:06:45,266
- Cut!
- That's enough...

64
00:06:46,728 --> 00:06:51,278
Ms. Minase, that take was incredible!

65
00:06:51,278 --> 00:06:54,819
I honestly thought I was going to be killed.

66
00:06:55,538 --> 00:06:57,225
Ms. Minase?

67
00:07:02,008 --> 00:07:04,078
Thank you very much.

68
00:07:05,948 --> 00:07:07,538
Oh?

69
00:07:08,908 --> 00:07:12,278
<i>I really got into character
during today's shoot!</i>

70
00:07:13,908 --> 00:07:16,300
[I'm glad to hear it.]
[Mom]

71
00:07:27,388 --> 00:07:28,558
Hello?

72
00:07:28,558 --> 00:07:31,388
Hey, what's with that article?

73
00:07:31,388 --> 00:07:33,018
[Growing Up With a Toxic Parent]

74
00:07:33,018 --> 00:07:34,899
[Revenge Against His Mother?]

75
00:07:37,218 --> 00:07:38,798
What about it?

76
00:07:39,808 --> 00:07:43,588
This makes me look like some terrible mother!

77
00:07:43,588 --> 00:07:46,218
That article made another man leave me,

78
00:07:46,218 --> 00:07:48,348
so take responsibility!

79
00:07:49,418 --> 00:07:51,728
Responsibility?

80
00:07:51,728 --> 00:07:53,098
It's all true anyway.

81
00:07:53,098 --> 00:07:56,448
I'm getting proper compensation for this.

82
00:07:58,628 --> 00:08:01,558
I lost my job too, you know.

83
00:08:04,268 --> 00:08:06,948
I can't give you money anymore.

84
00:08:08,188 --> 00:08:10,378
Oh, really?

85
00:08:10,378 --> 00:08:13,298
You think you can say that?

86
00:08:13,298 --> 00:08:17,278
<i>That girl who stood up for you the other day.</i>

87
00:08:17,908 --> 00:08:21,278
Ama Minase, was it?

88
00:08:22,328 --> 00:08:25,678
<i>She's pretty popular lately, isn't she?</i>

89
00:08:26,838 --> 00:08:32,068
I could sell a scandal about that girl
for a pretty penny.

90
00:08:32,068 --> 00:08:33,288
Stop!

91
00:08:33,288 --> 00:08:35,528
Don't drag Ama into this!

92
00:08:39,388 --> 00:08:41,348
Fine, I get it.

93
00:08:42,938 --> 00:08:45,318
<i>I'll get the money ready.</i>

94
00:08:46,768 --> 00:08:50,528
No matter how much you hate me,

95
00:08:51,218 --> 00:08:54,568
I'm never letting you go.

96
00:08:55,558 --> 00:08:57,678
Forever.

97
00:08:58,408 --> 00:09:00,298
Until the day I die.

98
00:09:04,758 --> 00:09:08,088
But I'll never let you go
until the day I die.

99
00:09:11,098 --> 00:09:14,348
<i>Alright, hurry up then.</i>

100
00:09:39,968 --> 00:09:42,128
Good work today.

101
00:09:54,228 --> 00:09:57,168
You and Chiaki...

102
00:10:00,908 --> 00:10:02,728
are pretty similar.

103
00:10:04,038 --> 00:10:05,278
Huh?

104
00:10:06,108 --> 00:10:07,668
Good work today.

105
00:10:20,548 --> 00:10:24,310
<i>What time are you done?
I'll come pick you up.</i>

106
00:10:36,728 --> 00:10:37,828
Thanks for coming...

107
00:10:37,828 --> 00:10:40,028
Did you see anyone weird?

108
00:10:40,028 --> 00:10:42,951
- Huh?
- Like someone following you?

109
00:10:44,728 --> 00:10:46,881
No, I'm fine.

110
00:10:50,768 --> 00:10:52,658
I see.

111
00:10:53,808 --> 00:10:55,698
What's wrong?

112
00:10:57,888 --> 00:10:59,498
No,

113
00:11:01,128 --> 00:11:03,008
it's nothing.

114
00:11:38,098 --> 00:11:41,798
What's that attitude towards your mother?

115
00:11:43,148 --> 00:11:44,998
Hand them over, now.

116
00:11:44,998 --> 00:11:47,298
Your bank book and card.

117
00:11:50,918 --> 00:11:52,528
Are you listening?

118
00:11:52,528 --> 00:11:55,178
You got paid, didn't you?

119
00:11:56,578 --> 00:11:58,808
Hurry up! Give them to me!

120
00:12:12,618 --> 00:12:16,688
Don't get cocky
just because you're a celebrity.

121
00:12:18,348 --> 00:12:20,948
Your face is all you've got.

122
00:12:25,838 --> 00:12:27,798
That face...

123
00:12:27,798 --> 00:12:30,188
You look just like your father.

124
00:12:30,868 --> 00:12:33,338
You're nothing but trouble!

125
00:12:43,438 --> 00:12:47,648
<i>Women exist to hurt me.</i>

126
00:12:49,988 --> 00:12:52,678
<i>So I'll hurt them first.</i>

127
00:12:55,268 --> 00:12:57,698
<i>I've always thought that, but...</i>

128
00:13:13,478 --> 00:13:16,128
<i>Ama saved me.</i>

129
00:13:17,328 --> 00:13:19,078
I love you,

130
00:13:20,258 --> 00:13:22,468
Chiaki.

131
00:13:28,888 --> 00:13:32,608
<i>Ama loves me.</i>

132
00:13:39,278 --> 00:13:42,028
<i>I never want to let her go.</i>

133
00:13:43,278 --> 00:13:45,198
Stop!

134
00:13:46,538 --> 00:13:49,168
<i>I won't let her go.</i>

135
00:13:54,778 --> 00:13:57,218
<i>If it's to protect Ama,</i>

136
00:13:58,288 --> 00:14:00,868
<i>I'll do whatever it takes.</i>

137
00:14:05,028 --> 00:14:06,588
<i>But...</i>

138
00:14:07,328 --> 00:14:10,208
I'm never letting you go.

139
00:14:10,208 --> 00:14:11,708
Forever.

140
00:14:11,708 --> 00:14:13,728
Until the day I die.

141
00:14:23,098 --> 00:14:24,628
<i>Am I...</i>

142
00:14:26,048 --> 00:14:27,578
<i>able to...</i>

143
00:14:28,598 --> 00:14:30,438
<i>protect Ama?</i>

144
00:14:31,708 --> 00:14:34,548
Chiaki, is there anything I can help with?

145
00:14:36,038 --> 00:14:37,648
Oh, no!

146
00:14:43,638 --> 00:14:45,268
Does it hurt?

147
00:14:47,668 --> 00:14:50,748
Yeah, it hurts.

148
00:14:54,388 --> 00:14:56,248
I know!

149
00:14:56,248 --> 00:15:00,418
The greedy little ghost
is gonna gobble up all the ouchies!

150
00:15:00,418 --> 00:15:03,698
Nom, nom, nom!

151
00:15:07,928 --> 00:15:10,458
I do this for my little brothers.

152
00:15:10,458 --> 00:15:11,778
Sorry.

153
00:15:16,228 --> 00:15:17,968
Thank you.

154
00:15:48,988 --> 00:15:53,678
<i>How can I get rid of this anxiety?</i>

155
00:16:03,238 --> 00:16:04,978
It's okay to sleep.

156
00:16:06,368 --> 00:16:09,788
No, I'm okay.

157
00:17:22,708 --> 00:17:25,548
Sorry, I fell asleep.

158
00:17:26,468 --> 00:17:28,298
You're exhausted.

159
00:17:28,298 --> 00:17:30,048
You should rest.

160
00:17:33,028 --> 00:17:36,948
I have a favor to ask you, Chiaki.

161
00:17:38,058 --> 00:17:39,498
What is it?

162
00:17:40,268 --> 00:17:44,898
I'm planning a picnic
with my family on our next day off.

163
00:17:44,898 --> 00:17:47,268
Will you come with us?

164
00:17:47,268 --> 00:17:51,098
My siblings want to see you, Chiaki.

165
00:17:54,858 --> 00:17:56,148
Yeah.

166
00:17:57,288 --> 00:18:00,498
They'll be so happy.

167
00:18:13,158 --> 00:18:15,808
Wow, amazing.

168
00:18:16,768 --> 00:18:19,158
Let's eat.

169
00:18:19,158 --> 00:18:21,378
Where do I start? I want this one!

170
00:18:21,378 --> 00:18:23,168
Please eat up, Chiaki.

171
00:18:23,168 --> 00:18:24,278
Okay.

172
00:18:24,278 --> 00:18:26,488
Oh, then I want a sausage next.

173
00:18:26,488 --> 00:18:28,448
A sausage?

174
00:18:28,448 --> 00:18:29,868
Yeah, it's delicious.

175
00:18:29,868 --> 00:18:31,738
It is delicious, isn't it?

176
00:18:31,738 --> 00:18:33,098
I'm glad it's sunny!

177
00:18:33,098 --> 00:18:34,558
Yeah!

178
00:18:34,558 --> 00:18:35,828
Sei, Nagi, is it good?

179
00:18:35,828 --> 00:18:37,448
Yeah!

180
00:18:37,448 --> 00:18:39,308
And Chiaki's here too!

181
00:18:39,308 --> 00:18:40,668
I'm so happy.

182
00:18:40,668 --> 00:18:42,588
Yeah!

183
00:18:42,588 --> 00:18:44,158
Here I go!

184
00:18:44,158 --> 00:18:45,728
Take that!

185
00:18:45,728 --> 00:18:47,408
Chiaki, you're bad at this!

186
00:18:47,408 --> 00:18:48,758
So bad!

187
00:18:48,758 --> 00:18:50,298
You two are pretty good.

188
00:18:50,298 --> 00:18:52,258
- I did it!
- Yeah!

189
00:18:56,548 --> 00:19:00,768
Alright! Sei, Nagi, get ready.

190
00:19:01,778 --> 00:19:03,688
Take that!

191
00:19:03,688 --> 00:19:06,098
How's that?
Your sister's awesome, right!

192
00:19:06,098 --> 00:19:06,988
Awesome!

193
00:19:06,988 --> 00:19:09,698
- Do it again!
- One more time!

194
00:19:15,828 --> 00:19:19,138
Are you feeling well?

195
00:19:19,138 --> 00:19:23,078
Yes, I've been feeling much better lately.

196
00:19:23,718 --> 00:19:25,898
I'm glad to hear that.

197
00:19:30,738 --> 00:19:35,997
I've put Ama through so much
because of my poor health.

198
00:19:36,828 --> 00:19:40,148
She's always worked so hard for our family.

199
00:19:43,388 --> 00:19:48,778
But, she looks so happy acting.

200
00:19:48,778 --> 00:19:52,578
She tells me about roles
she wants to try next.

201
00:19:52,578 --> 00:19:55,728
It's the first time Ama has had a dream,

202
00:19:55,728 --> 00:19:57,478
so I'm overjoyed.

203
00:20:01,288 --> 00:20:03,248
I see.

204
00:20:08,138 --> 00:20:12,908
I heard you're the one
who gave her that dream.

205
00:20:13,858 --> 00:20:18,218
Thank you so much.

206
00:20:18,858 --> 00:20:21,798
Please, don't say that.

207
00:20:21,798 --> 00:20:24,360
I didn't do anything.

208
00:20:26,888 --> 00:20:29,693
It's because Ama has talent.

209
00:20:32,278 --> 00:20:36,638
To think Ama has someone
as wonderful as you in her life...

210
00:20:37,228 --> 00:20:39,448
I'm so grateful.

211
00:20:40,708 --> 00:20:41,968
Huh?

212
00:20:44,258 --> 00:20:47,348
It's all because of you
that my life is a mess!

213
00:20:47,348 --> 00:20:49,928
I wish I'd never given birth to you.

214
00:20:49,928 --> 00:20:52,588
You're nothing but trouble!

215
00:20:56,578 --> 00:21:01,368
I'm... not wonderful.

216
00:21:01,368 --> 00:21:04,328
Chiaki! Mom!

217
00:22:01,658 --> 00:22:07,015
Sei and Nagi keep saying every day
how fun the picnic was.

218
00:22:07,648 --> 00:22:09,408
I see.

219
00:22:09,408 --> 00:22:12,128
I want to go again with everyone.

220
00:22:14,238 --> 00:22:16,228
Yeah.

221
00:22:16,228 --> 00:22:21,048
Oh... I got an offer for a late-night drama.

222
00:22:21,048 --> 00:22:23,628
And I'm the lead.

223
00:22:25,098 --> 00:22:27,118
That's amazing.

224
00:22:27,118 --> 00:22:32,018
I still can't believe they want me.

225
00:22:33,668 --> 00:22:35,438
That's great.

226
00:22:36,608 --> 00:22:38,018
Yeah!

227
00:22:42,198 --> 00:22:43,898
Hey, Ama.

228
00:22:52,568 --> 00:22:53,988
What is it?

229
00:23:03,678 --> 00:23:05,428
I think...

230
00:23:06,668 --> 00:23:08,288
we should break up.

231
00:23:12,018 --> 00:23:13,378
What?

232
00:23:20,348 --> 00:23:22,498
Goodbye, Ama.

233
00:23:22,498 --> 00:23:23,858
How are things with Chiaki?

234
00:23:23,858 --> 00:23:25,148
We broke up.

235
00:23:25,148 --> 00:23:28,958
It was ridiculous that
someone like me could even be with Chiaki.

236
00:23:28,958 --> 00:23:31,238
I still love you, Ama.

237
00:23:31,238 --> 00:23:34,178
I think you're the only one who can save him.

238
00:23:34,178 --> 00:23:37,038
If Ama dates me, she'll only end up unhappy.

239
00:23:37,038 --> 00:23:39,128
I'm nothing but trouble.

240
00:23:39,128 --> 00:23:41,328
You saved me.

241
00:23:41,328 --> 00:23:43,168
Now it's my turn to...

242
00:23:43,168 --> 00:23:46,128
Chiaki! Hey, Chiaki!

243
00:23:46,128 --> 00:23:49,808
I'll do anything for you, Chiaki.

